  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145448",
      "title": "Navigating with the \"Link\" Component",
      "lectureOrder": 238,
      "videoOrder": 222,
      "sourceHash": "06f25632b7f69b9b5cacbf2517fec42c79115804b2492ab0d9fa596abfc0ca37",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "So now we built a bunch of dummy components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 8.71,
          "en": "a bunch of dummy page components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.71,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "Of course our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 13.03,
          "en": "If you want to call it like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.03,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "isn't doing anything useful though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "And it's not doing anything useful on purpose",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 21.32,
          "en": "because I just wanna to show these core features first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.32,
          "end": 23.73,
          "en": "before we then later combined what we know to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.73,
          "end": 28.3,
          "en": "build something more realistic, to build a real application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.3,
          "end": 31.55,
          "en": "Now, up to this point, we have all those different pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.55,
          "end": 34.69,
          "en": "and components, but we can only navigate between them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.69,
          "end": 37.49,
          "en": "by manually changing the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.49,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "And that's of course not very realistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 44.97,
          "en": "In reality, we typically wanna navigate through links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.97,
          "end": 48.59,
          "en": "or programmatically when some action completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.59,
          "end": 50.96,
          "en": "and therefore that what we're going to have a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.96,
          "end": 55.92,
          "en": "right now and for this let's go to our main index JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.92,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "So directly in the pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 60.483,
          "en": "this homepage component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.36,
          "end": 63.44,
          "en": "there, let's say we now also wanna",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.44,
          "end": 66.82,
          "en": "add a bunch of links so we can add a unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.82,
          "end": 69.61,
          "en": "component with a couple of lists items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.61,
          "end": 73.98,
          "en": "And then in every list item, we want to have a link to some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.98,
          "end": 76.07,
          "en": "of those pages we created here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.07,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "For example, we could add links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 81.43299999999999,
          "en": "to the portfolio index and to our clients index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.4,
          "end": 83.87,
          "en": "Now, how do we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.87,
          "end": 87.2,
          "en": "Normally we add links with an anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.2,
          "end": 89.49,
          "en": "We can do this here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.49,
          "end": 93.513,
          "en": "We could add a link like this and it would work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.39,
          "end": 96.43,
          "en": "but this has a disadvantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.43,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "Now let's add it like this though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 100.35,
          "en": "Let's add a link as an anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.99000000000001,
          "end": 105.84,
          "en": "Hence if we go back to just our domain slash nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.84,
          "end": 107.69,
          "en": "we see that link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.69,
          "end": 111.02000000000001,
          "en": "If I click it, I'm taken to the portfolio page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.02000000000001,
          "end": 113.87,
          "en": "It works, but it has a disadvantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.87,
          "end": 118.87,
          "en": "The disadvantage here is that with such a standard link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119,
          "end": 122.79,
          "en": "we in the end send a brand new HTTP request to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.79,
          "end": 127.55,
          "en": "load this new page, which means that any application state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.55,
          "end": 131.77,
          "en": "we might have when our running React app would be lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.77,
          "end": 135.14,
          "en": "If we have some App-wide state, which is stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.14,
          "end": 137.65,
          "en": "with React context or Redux,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.65,
          "end": 140.50900000000001,
          "en": "it would be lost since we send a brand new request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.50900000000001,
          "end": 144.97,
          "en": "and we get a brand new HTML page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.97,
          "end": 149.07,
          "en": "And that's not really the idea of building a React app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.07,
          "end": 152.65,
          "en": "no matter if you're using Next.js or not, you wanna stay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.65,
          "end": 155.87,
          "en": "in that app and you want to manage App-wide state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.87,
          "end": 160.84,
          "en": "That shouldn't change just because you use Next.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.84,
          "end": 163.67000000000002,
          "en": "because if that would not work this way anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.67000000000002,
          "end": 167.053,
          "en": "it would actually be a disadvantage and not an improvement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.23,
          "end": 172.09,
          "en": "So therefore we typically don't want to use links like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.09,
          "end": 177.09,
          "en": "Instead when using React Router in a non Next application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.26,
          "end": 181.23,
          "en": "we import a link component from React Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.23,
          "end": 183.97,
          "en": "And with Next.js, it's the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.97,
          "end": 187.03,
          "en": "for this we again import something from Next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.03,
          "end": 191.23,
          "en": "but now not from Next router, but from Next link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.23,
          "end": 193.98,
          "en": "And we import link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.98,
          "end": 197.12,
          "en": "Important here not between curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.12,
          "end": 199.56,
          "en": "because link is the default export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.56,
          "end": 202.863,
          "en": "of this link package from the Next library.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 205.57999999999998,
          "en": "So we import link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.29,
          "en": "and the link is a component which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 212.65,
          "en": "and we can use it as a replacement for the anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.65,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "So we can simply replace a with link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 221.04,
          "en": "Now link has a href prop, which we can set, so we don't even",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.04,
          "end": 222.42000000000002,
          "en": "need to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.42000000000002,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "And the href prop also takes a string with the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 227.16,
          "end": 229.06,
          "en": "to which we wanna navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.06,
          "end": 230.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, if we save that therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.92000000000002,
          "end": 234.323,
          "en": "and we go back to our starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.53,
          "end": 238.5,
          "en": "If I now click on portfolio,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.5,
          "end": 240.48,
          "en": "I still go to the portfolio page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.48,
          "end": 244.8,
          "en": "But now without sending a HTTP request behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.8,
          "end": 248.47,
          "en": "without losing any app-state we might have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.47,
          "end": 251.64,
          "en": "and the link component actually also has a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 251.64,
          "end": 253.97,
          "en": "of other tricks up its sleeve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.97,
          "end": 256.11,
          "en": "It has a couple of other improvements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.11,
          "end": 259.55,
          "en": "For example, it automatically pre fetches any data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.55,
          "end": 262.527,
          "en": "off the page we might navigate to as soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.527,
          "end": 264.94,
          "en": "as we hover over the link and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.94,
          "end": 267.96,
          "en": "So these are some advanced optimizations which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.96,
          "end": 269.513,
          "en": "will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 270.72,
          "end": 272.29,
          "en": "Now on this link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.29,
          "end": 276.32,
          "en": "we can also set a couple of other props of, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 276.32,
          "end": 281.32,
          "en": "we can set a replace prop to not push this new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 281.42,
          "end": 283.93,
          "en": "but replace the current page with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 283.93,
          "end": 287.85699999999997,
          "en": "So that we can't go back that can sometimes be useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 287.85699999999997,
          "end": 290.673,
          "en": "And we can also set a couple of other options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.673,
          "end": 293.99,
          "en": "which we'll dive in later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 293.99,
          "end": 296.903,
          "en": "For the moment href is the most important option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.55,
          "end": 301.36,
          "en": "And therefore of course, now we can add another list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.36,
          "end": 305.84,
          "en": "with another link where we wanna go to our clients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.84,
          "end": 310.84,
          "en": "So here we could then set href to slash clients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 311.09,
          "end": 313.87,
          "en": "to be taken to that client's page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.87,
          "end": 317.21,
          "en": "If you go back and reload this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 317.21,
          "end": 319.493,
          "en": "and go to clients here we are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 320.4,
          "end": 322.21,
          "en": "Now on that client's page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.21,
          "end": 325.46,
          "en": "we might want to go to our individual clients.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 325.46,
          "end": 330,
          "en": "So we want to plug in a value for that dynamic ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 330,
          "end": 334.08,
          "en": "and therefore an index JS in the client's folder here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 334.08,
          "end": 336.12,
          "en": "I also want to add a couple of links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.12,
          "end": 339.22,
          "en": "and I want to now navigate to dynamic routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 339.22,
          "end": 341.2,
          "en": "And that's what we're going to take a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 341.2,
          "end": 342.493,
          "en": "in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
